                                "sense_id": "f8669c95-a6b5-3f5f-afbb-747e27ebb199",
                                "text": "our allowance was somewhat bettered, by a daily proportion of Bisket, which the sailers would pilfer to sell, give, or exchange with us, for money, Saxefras, furres, or love."
                            }
                        ]
